        "TileImage": "$($repository f9c3905a-ec94-43b6-aae6-8b2f752467f7).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning 47,\rWe&apos;ve finally done it. We found the perpetrators who stole your groove. Time to take it back, with vengence. It wont be easy. They somehow split it into three even groovets. With a little finesse and a lot of luck, you may just be able to find your groove and get it back all in the same mission\rI&apos;ll leave you to prepare",
